1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,197
Side by side.

2
00:00:01,197 --> 00:00:10,520
Newton assumed isothermal changes, so B equals P, giving two hundred and eighty metres per second, sixteen percent too low.

3
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:19,257
Laplace realised the changes are adiabatic, so B equals gamma P, giving three hundred and thirty one, which agrees.

